  {
    "insert": "\nThe exposé outlines a research project exploring the opportunities and challenges of using holographic AI agents in music education. Through a mixed-methods approach involving interviews and questionnaires, it aims to understand the perceptions of teachers, learners, and parents across different educational settings. \n"
