    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "While the exposé references relevant literature, the theoretical framework lacks detail on how it will inform empirical instrument development. You should elaborate on how specific design principles or characteristics of holographic AI agents from the literature will shape the interview questions and questionnaires."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
