    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "The exposé does not address ethical issues related to the use of holographic AI agents in education, such as data privacy, potential biases, or the impact on teacher employment. I suggest including a brief discussion on how ethical concerns will be managed in the study and addressed in the research findings."
  },
