  },
  {
    "insert": "Although the exposé highlights gaps in the literature, it could better justify why these gaps are significant for the broader adoption of holographic AI agents. Also, the exposé does not reference many publications, and the bibliography has some inconsistencies. Fixing these issues and broadening the spectrum of literature review would strengthen the exposé significantly."
